WEBVTT

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.253
(drumroll)

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:08.216
(rousing orchestral fanfare playing)

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.062
(fanfare ends)
美国二十世纪福斯公司出品

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.448
♪♪

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.832
(wind whistling)

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.677
(sniffing)

00:00:54.262 --> 00:00:56.222
(snuffling)

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:00.268
(gasps, laughs)

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:01.561
(rumbling, grunts)

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:02.479
(screams)

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:04.856
(chattering nervously)

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:10.195
(gasps)

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:14.240
(grunting with effort)

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:15.492
(bell dings)

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.577
(screams)

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.913
(grunts, screams)

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.374
(whimpers, roaring)

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.502
Yee-haw!

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:26.711
(gulps)

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:27.921
(strained grunting)

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:29.255
(screams)

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:30.381
(whooshing)

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:31.341
(screams)

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:35.470
(bell dinging repeatedly)
地球内部 上地幔

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:37.639
(screaming)

00:01:37.722 --> 00:01:38.890
(sizzling)

00:01:38.973 --> 00:01:40.225
(grunts, pants)

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:42.143
(whimpers)

00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:46.898
(sniffing)

00:01:46.981 --> 00:01:48.691
(rumbling)

00:01:50.151 --> 00:01:52.529
(grunting, panting)

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:55.490
(rumbling)

00:01:55.573 --> 00:01:56.950
(grunting)

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:08.628
Huh?

00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:13.675
SPORTS ANNOUNCER:
Goal!
进球

00:02:13.758 --> 00:02:15.135
(grunting)

00:02:15.218 --> 00:02:16.803
(screams, grunts)

00:02:16.886 --> 00:02:18.513
(grunting in pain)

00:02:23.184 --> 00:02:25.019
(grunting in pain)

00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:27.105
(screaming)

00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:29.816
(gasps, screams)

00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:31.234
(jabbering)

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.027
(strained grunting)

00:02:37.073 --> 00:02:38.992
(whimpers)

00:02:39.075 --> 00:02:42.537
(screaming)

00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:47.750
(screams, gasps)

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.962
(whimpers)

00:02:51.045 --> 00:02:52.672
(inhales deeply)

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.799
(pained grunt)

00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:56.801
(groans, gasps)

00:02:56.885 --> 00:02:58.261
(whimpers)

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.305
(grunts, screams)

00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:02.056
(whimpering)

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.350
(screams)

00:03:10.148 --> 00:03:12.066
(rumbling)
冰川时代4

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:24.078
♪♪

00:03:24.162 --> 00:03:25.163
Huh? What was that?
什么声音

00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:26.414
Ellie, did you hear that?
艾莉 你听到没有

00:03:26.497 --> 00:03:27.498
I heard it, Manny.
听到了 曼尼

00:03:27.582 --> 00:03:29.042
Whatever it is,
it's miles away.
不管是什么 反正远得很

00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:30.543
Peaches, you all right?
桃子 你没事吧

00:03:31.252 --> 00:03:32.086
Where is she?
她去哪儿了

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.130
No teenager's
ever up early.
现在的小孩才不会早起呢

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:35.048
(chuckling):
Whoa.
现在的小孩才不会早起呢

00:03:35.423 --> 00:03:37.675
Easy, warden.
She's not on lockdown.
别担心 典狱长 她又不是囚犯

00:03:38.092 --> 00:03:39.552
(soft snoring)

00:03:40.929 --> 00:03:42.263
(jabbering)

00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:44.974
You two were supposed
to be responsible uncles.
你们两个叔叔到底有没有责任心

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:47.936
What? I didn't see Peaches sneak
off maybe 15, 20 minutes ago.
我不知道桃子
十几分钟前溜出去这件事

00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:49.771
Or that she went with Louis
to the falls.
也不知道她和路易斯去了瀑布

00:03:49.854 --> 00:03:50.939
-(both chuckle anxiously)
-MANNY: The falls?
去瀑布

00:03:51.022 --> 00:03:53.107
-Where the delinquents go?
-ELLIE: Relax.
那个小流氓聚集地

00:03:53.191 --> 00:03:54.609
It's just where
the kids hang out.
别紧张 不就是小孩子玩的地方嘛

00:03:54.692 --> 00:03:57.487
No, no. It's a gateway hangout.
不 不 玩玩就学坏了

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:00.198
First it's the falls,
then she's piercing her trunk,
然后她穿了象鼻环

00:04:00.281 --> 00:04:02.450
and the next thing you know,
she's addicted to berries.
然后不知道哪一天她就对浆果上瘾了

00:04:02.533 --> 00:04:03.868
(chuckling): Manny.
曼尼 你有点反应过激了

00:04:03.952 --> 00:04:06.037
You are overreacting.
曼尼 你有点反应过激了

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.122
She's not going to be
your little girl forever.
她不会永远是你的宝贝女儿的

00:04:08.456 --> 00:04:09.832
I know.
我知道

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.834
That's what worries me.
这就是我担心的

00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:14.170
(whooping, laughing)

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:15.171
PEACHES: Come on.
来吧

00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:17.548
Whoo-hoo! Whoo!
来吧

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:18.925
(laughs) Louis!
路易斯

00:04:19.509 --> 00:04:21.177
Would you get your head
out of the ground for once
你就不能从地下出来一次好好玩玩吗

00:04:21.261 --> 00:04:22.804
and try to have a little fun?
你就不能从地下出来一次好好玩玩吗

00:04:23.429 --> 00:04:24.806
-(thud)
-Ow!

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:26.099
I'm a molehog.
我是头鼹猪

00:04:26.182 --> 00:04:28.142
My head's supposed
to be underground.
躲在地底下是我的天性

00:04:28.226 --> 00:04:30.395
And my idea of fun
isn't risking death
冒生命危险陪你来见
猛犸美男也不好玩

00:04:30.478 --> 00:04:32.438
so that you can meet
some cute mammoth.
冒生命危险陪你来见
猛犸美男也不好玩

00:04:32.522 --> 00:04:34.357
Ethan isn't cute.
伊森不是美男

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.150
-He's hot.
-(sighs)
他是性感

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:39.445
Besides, you can't spend your
whole life playing it safe.
再说 没点刺激的人生有什么好的

00:04:39.529 --> 00:04:40.363
MANNY: I know I would.
我觉得挺好

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:41.322
(gasps) Dad?
爸爸

00:04:41.906 --> 00:04:43.658
There's no reason
to be mad.
你千万别发脾气

00:04:43.741 --> 00:04:46.619
You know how I feel about you
going to the falls.
你知道我对你去瀑布会有什么想法

00:04:46.703 --> 00:04:47.704
-Especially alone.
-(Louis clears throat)
尤其是一个人

00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:49.622
She's, uh, not alone, sir.
她不是一个人 先生

00:04:49.706 --> 00:04:50.873
You don't count, Wiener.
你不算 小鼹

00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:52.875
Yes, there's my place,
and you just put me in it.
没错 确实不算

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:54.460
-Thank you.
-Come on, young lady.
走吧 小鬼头

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:57.005
We're going home
where I can keep an eye on you.
跟我回家去 我要好好看住你

00:04:57.588 --> 00:04:58.673
(chuckles)

00:04:59.382 --> 00:05:01.759
So, sh...
should I just, um,
那我接下来是等你呢 还是

00:05:01.843 --> 00:05:03.386
wait here or...
那我接下来是等你呢 还是

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:04.846
-(rumbling)
-(gasps)
那我接下来是等你呢 还是

00:05:04.929 --> 00:05:07.098
(yells)

00:05:07.181 --> 00:05:09.934
(panting, grunting)

00:05:11.769 --> 00:05:12.603
Huh?

00:05:12.687 --> 00:05:14.564
(rumbling, birds screeching)

00:05:16.232 --> 00:05:17.525
(chuckles)

00:05:17.608 --> 00:05:18.943
(roaring fiercely)

00:05:21.362 --> 00:05:23.906
Yeah, you don't scare me,
Mother Nature.
才吓不倒我呢 大自然

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.617
There's nothing you can throw
at me that I can't handle.
无论你给我什么考验我都应付得了

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:28.036
-(whooping)
-Huh?
无论你给我什么考验我都应付得了

00:05:28.119 --> 00:05:30.163
(gasps, grunts)

00:05:30.788 --> 00:05:32.457
-(whoops)
-I think we're almost there.
我觉得我们快到了

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.751
We'd better be.
I just lost the steering.
我刚把方向盘弄坏了

00:05:35.126 --> 00:05:37.045
(pants, screams)

00:05:37.128 --> 00:05:39.047
(screaming)

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.840
Has anyone seen Precious?
有谁看见宝宝了吗

00:05:40.923 --> 00:05:42.050
It's her feeding time.
该喂她东西吃了

00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:45.178
Mom, Granny's talking
about her dead pet again.
奶奶又在找她死掉的宠物了

00:05:45.261 --> 00:05:46.971
Hey, paws up, everybody.
嘿 大家把手挥起来

00:05:47.055 --> 00:05:48.014
(all groaning)
嘿 大家把手挥起来

00:05:48.097 --> 00:05:49.599
Paws down,
Uncle, please.
快把手放下叔叔

00:05:49.682 --> 00:05:50.808
That is nasty.
实在太臭了

00:05:50.892 --> 00:05:51.809
Whoo-hoo!
实在太臭了

00:05:51.893 --> 00:05:53.603
(all yelling)

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:57.982
Be careful, Milton.
You're going to hurt somebody.
当心点 弥尔顿 别伤到什么人

00:05:58.066 --> 00:05:59.275
-(gasps)
-Aah!
大坏猫

00:05:59.359 --> 00:06:01.152
-Bad kitty.
-Rock!
有石头

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:03.154
(screaming)

00:06:03.237 --> 00:06:05.114
(grunting)

00:06:05.198 --> 00:06:06.032
(screams)

00:06:06.115 --> 00:06:08.159
Whoo!

00:06:08.242 --> 00:06:09.577
(screaming)

00:06:12.747 --> 00:06:14.040
Okay, so tell me,
好吧 那你说

00:06:14.123 --> 00:06:15.375
when exactly
will I be allowed
到底什么时候我才能跟男孩子一起玩

00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:16.542
to hang out with boys?
到底什么时候我才能跟男孩子一起玩

00:06:16.626 --> 00:06:17.543
When I'm dead.
等我死了

00:06:17.627 --> 00:06:20.213
Plus three days--
just to make sure I'm dead.
看我是不是真死了

00:06:20.296 --> 00:06:23.383
-(Diego grunting)
-(sloths whooping)

00:06:23.466 --> 00:06:24.592
(grunts, gasps)

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:28.304
(sighs, growls)

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:30.098
(grunting)

00:06:30.181 --> 00:06:32.517
(screaming)

